  "description": "WPF display and shape-editing controls for the CvInspect machine-vision toolkit — Mat image display with zoom/pan/pixel probe, renderer-neutral overlay drawing, and draggable teaching shapes that write back to tool option POCOs. Based on OpenCvSharp; the native OpenCV runtime is chosen by the consumer (e.g. OpenCvSharp4.runtime.win).",
